{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-62","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：二项无理线段与中项无理线段与平方","englishTitle":"The square on the second bimedial straight line applied to a rational straight line produces as breadth the third binomial.","book":10,"number":62,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.62","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.62/","group":"prop_2","sourceNumber":62,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-62@raw-c448a002ca4635ea","contentId":"euclid-10-62","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c448a002ca4635ea5dfa34d9db1d90677d7d2a211dbba349455e358342468f0c","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-62.statement","euclid-10-62.construction.1","euclid-10-62.construction.2","euclid-10-62.proof.1","euclid-10-62.proof.2","euclid-10-62.proof.3","euclid-10-62.proof.4","euclid-10-62.proof.5","euclid-10-62.proof.6","euclid-10-62.proof.7","euclid-10-62.proof.8","euclid-10-62.proof.9","euclid-10-62.proof.10","euclid-10-62.proof.11","euclid-10-62.conclusion","euclid-10-62.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-62.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-62","revisionId":"euclid-10-62@raw-c448a002ca4635ea","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a7cea3e0038dff7ed5099e95c73d4344556302657e6feca8f043e254db560fc7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"The square on the second bimedial straight line applied to a rational straight line produces as breadth the third binomial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"第二双中项无理线段直线上的正方形适用于有理线段直线,以宽度表示第三二项无理线段直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-62.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-62","revisionId":"euclid-10-62@raw-c448a002ca4635ea","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"68a2e9e21e90403bf516b7b12b70e3df12266308b99cdba52f6e8d4884737799","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be a second bimedial straight line divided into its medials at C, so that AC is the greater segment; let DE be any rational straight line, and to DE let there be applied the parallelogram DF equal to the square on AB and producing DG as its breadth; I say that DG is a third binomial straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB成为第二条双中项无理线段直线,将其中间线分为C,AC,数量部分更大;让DE成为有理线段,DE,宽度为正方形,宽度为正方形,宽度为DG;我说,DG是第三条二项无理线段。（相关点与线段：DF）"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-62.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-62","revisionId":"euclid-10-62@raw-c448a002ca4635ea","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6f05b40f38e9703450a76b53958750b66bcf29a76d3f800c156ce3bcbe8c9bcd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the same construction be made as before shown."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"做同样的工程 之前显示。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-62.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-62","revisionId":"euclid-10-62@raw-c448a002ca4635ea","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c8da36eedabc719fc754f933117acf01281668f501e1d0bc10c4dbf0cf0ac4e5","citations":["euclid-10-38","euclid-10-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since AB is a second bimedial divided at C, therefore AC, CB are medial straight lines commensurable in square only and containing a medial rectangle, [[X. 38](/principles/euclid-10-38)] so that the sum of the squares on AC, CB is also medial. [[X. 15 and 23 Por.](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB是第二双中项无理线段除以C,AC,CB是中项无理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度,中项无理线段,矩形,因此,AC的正方形和AC的总数也是中项无理线段。 [[X. 38](/principles/euclid-10-38)] [[X. 15 and 23 Por.](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-62.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-62","revisionId":"euclid-10-62@raw-c448a002ca4635ea","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"91088080d652ad97537bf56fc0a75ae91bef120f9906e709ff44fd973f81d3a6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is equal to DL; therefore DL is also medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"等于DL,因此DL也是中项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-62.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-62","revisionId":"euclid-10-62@raw-c448a002ca4635ea","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9bab32c624ea854e66c02833ed4f9975c2c26745db229e8e51a6dcd749fa0e6d","citations":["euclid-10-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is applied to the rational straight line DE; therefore MD is also rational and incommensurable in length with DE. [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"适用于有理线段 DE;因此,MD也为有理和不可公度,DE。 [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-62.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-62","revisionId":"euclid-10-62@raw-c448a002ca4635ea","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"00fb7a59e27f717db2a97b5731f16f4e25449b6e7e5a162215fd240dd72859d6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason, MG is also rational and incommensurable in length with ML, that is, with DE; therefore each of the straight lines DM, MG is rational and incommensurable in length with DE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,MG线的长度为有理,不可公度,ML,即DE;因此,DM直线、MG直线的长度分别为有理和不可公度,DE直线的长度分别为DE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-62.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-62","revisionId":"euclid-10-62@raw-c448a002ca4635ea","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"599398616b70539a5f011ecb2b20fa774114be69e7bdb5a158caea07245625c0","citations":["euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AC is incommensurable in length with CB, and, as AC is to CB, so is the square on AC to the rectangle AC, CB, therefore the square on AC is also incommensurable with the rectangle AC, CB. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于AC的长度是不可公度,CB的长度是AC,AC的比值相当于正方形的AC与矩形的CB的比值,因此,AC的比值也是不可公度的不可公度,矩形的AC和CB的比值 [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-62.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-62","revisionId":"euclid-10-62@raw-c448a002ca4635ea","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"327aefb401b9003be431db0db7304a504829e07dfffc28b72bcf3e6513a1a4d0","citations":["euclid-10-12","euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Hence the sum of the squares on AC, CB is incommensurable with twice the rectangle AC, CB, [[X. 12, 13](/principles/euclid-10-12)] that is, DL is incommensurable with MF, so that DM is also incommensurable with MG. [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1), [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AC和CB的正方形和不可公度是不可公度,是矩形和CB的两倍,即DL和MF是不可公度,因此DM和不可公度和MG也是不可公度  [ [[X. 12, 13](/principles/euclid-10-12)] [VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1) [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-62.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-62","revisionId":"euclid-10-62@raw-c448a002ca4635ea","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"85b1f3558af624091076fa915506e7271577405d93e2a888a44a5fc76881c8da","citations":["euclid-10-36"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And they are rational; therefore DG is binomial. [[X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"它们是有理,DG是二项无理线段。 [[X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-62.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-62","revisionId":"euclid-10-62@raw-c448a002ca4635ea","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e32c322a3731097787ee9db265e17abfed774e29125ccde9924c9702698b5307","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"It is to be proved that it is also a third binomial straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"需要证明的是,它也是第三条二项无理线段直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-62.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-62","revisionId":"euclid-10-62@raw-c448a002ca4635ea","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"20470502fbe63c8f27620e06bd6c6edef6fecdede24adc856e7335854b60b5f2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"In manner similar to the foregoing we may conclude that DM is greater than MG, and that DK is commensurable with KM."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"与上述情况相似,我们可以得出DM超过MG,DK超过可公度,KM超过KM的结论。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-62.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-62","revisionId":"euclid-10-62@raw-c448a002ca4635ea","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"73d7b02707276146370bd5e639b2669a5d9b5f2d64c8b1b41a96257445c3e110","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the rectangle DK, KM is equal to the square on MN; therefore the square on DM is greater than the square on MG by the square on a straight line commensurable with DM."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"矩形 DK KM等于MN的正方形;因此,DM的正方形比MG的正方形大于正方形,直线为可公度和DM。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-62.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-10-62","revisionId":"euclid-10-62@raw-c448a002ca4635ea","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"20fbb97bcbd7434ff352ced128b71ff2a16edbc39dbbfbecc43e54a93ded5840","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And neither of the straight lines DM, MG is commensurable in length with DE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DM线,MG线, DM线,DE线, 330线,；上述对应量可公度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-62.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-62","revisionId":"euclid-10-62@raw-c448a002ca4635ea","order":14,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d8747b5dd5d459f4a8bfb98170b012b369be1b81d46da06ecbe0ec9668975450","citations":["euclid-10-def-7"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore DG is a third binomial straight line. [[X. Deff. II. 3](/principles/euclid-10-def-7)] Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,DG是第三条二项无理线段直线,证毕。 [[X. Deff. II. 3](/principles/euclid-10-def-7)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-62.source","contentId":"euclid-10-62","revisionId":"euclid-10-62@raw-c448a002ca4635ea","order":15,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b6d3bde80051988e2d41431b6efa10c31dd5a71cb1173d2c49644cf76f885492","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.62/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.62\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-62:euclid-10-38:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-62","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-62.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-38","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.62","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.62/","sourceLabel":"X. 38"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-62:euclid-10-15:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-62","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-62.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-15","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.62","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.62/","sourceLabel":"X. 15 and 23 Por."}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-62:euclid-10-23:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-62","sourceBlockIds":[],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-23","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"per